        },
        {
          "text": "niyishimi yachipaŋu chanyeŋumukaku, nimayandayu, nimpopu jayu, ninyonjiyayu, niyuma yayu yejima, hamu namudimu wayu wejima, yuma yakatalaŋawu yakasendaŋawu mwakayitenenayu hejina hejina. ",
